BugInfo.Description:
程序错误的检查函数的返回值，它可能忽视程序的终止条件或者异常情况，从而导致程序产生异常。  

**例如**：下面代码片段中，程序错误的检查了`FileInputStream.read()`的返回值，程序将会一直执行下去，成为死循环，消耗大量的CPU资源。  
```java
...  
File file = new File(fileName);  
InputStream in = null;  
try {  
    in = new FileInputStream(file);  
    int a;  
    while ((a = in.read()) != 0) {  
        ...  
    }  
} catch (IOException e) {  
    e.printStackTrace();  
}finally{  
    if(in != null){  
        try {  
            in.close();  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            e.printStackTrace();  
        }  
    }  
}  
...
```

BugInfo.Advice:
检查程序逻辑，正确检查函数返回值。  

**例如**：下面代码片段中，程序正确的检查了`FileInputStream.read()`的返回值。  
```java
...  
File file = new File(fileName);  
InputStream in = null;  
try {  
    in = new FileInputStream(file);  
    int a;  
    while ((a = in.read()) != -1) {  
        ...  
    }  
} catch (IOException e) {  
    e.printStackTrace();  
}finally{  
    if(in != null){  
        try {  
            in.close();  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            e.printStackTrace();  
        }  
    }  
}  
...
```
